Description:
{Chapel Guard + any Holy creature}
Once per turn: Choose another creature you control. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to it until your next turn.
Enemy creatures that can reach this creature must attack it if they attack.

{Bellkeeper Monk + any Holy creature}
Radiance (restoring HP can go past max HP. Until end of turn, each point over max is +1 ATK; then the extra HP is lost).
At the start of your turn: Restore 3 HP to each of your creatures.

{Pain Drinker + any Unholy creature}
At the end of your turn: Lose 2 PHP. Whenever you lose PHP: This creature gains +1 ATK until end of turn.
Whenever this creature destroys a creature: Deal 2 damage to each enemy creature.

{Blood Priest + any Unholy creature}
Once per turn: Banish 2 cards from your Waste Repository to restore 5 HP to a creature or gain 5 PHP.
Whenever you sacrifice a creature: This creature gains +2 ATK permanently.

{any 2 Greedy creatures}
This creature rolls its die twice and keeps the higher result.
Once per turn: You may invest any amount of gold from your pool onto this creature. For each gold invested, choose +2 ATK or +2 HP permanently.

{Cat + Bunny}
If this creature doesn’t attack: Restore 1 HP to it at end phase.
Your opponent can only attack creatures with the name 'Bunny' or fusions which have splices named 'bunny' while this card is on the field.

{any Unholy creature + any Greedy creature}
At the start of your turn: This creature gains +1 ATK permanently for each creature that died since your last turn.
Whenever a creature dies: Gain 1 gold or 1 PHP.

{Judicator Angel + any Holy creature}
Radiance (restoring HP can go past max HP. Until end of turn, each point over max is +1 ATK; then the extra HP is lost).
When this creature attacks: Restore 2 HP to each of your creatures. When HP restored to this creature goes past its max, each point over is +2 ATK instead of +1.

{Goblin General + any Greedy creature}
Your 'Goblin' creatures roll their dice twice and keep the higher result. At the start of your turn: Gain 1 gold.
Your 'Goblin' creatures gain +1 ATK for every 5 gold in your pool.

{any Holy creature + any Greedy creature}
Radiance (restoring HP can go past max HP. Until end of turn, each point over max is +1 ATK; then the extra HP is lost).
Once per turn: Pay X gold to restore 2X HP to a creature you control.
